WEBVTT

00:13:28.412 --> 00:13:34.329
Research now shows that the radical
acceptance of all of our emotions,

00:13:34.329 --> 00:13:37.871
even the messy, difficult ones, is
the cornerstone to resilience,

00:13:38.162 --> 00:13:44.037
thriving and true authentic happiness. But
.

00:13:45.246 --> 00:13:48.662
Emotional agility is more than just
an acceptance of emotions,

00:13:48.662 --> 00:13:50.746
we also know that accuracy matters.

00:13:51.621 --> 00:13:55.912
In my own research, I found
that words are essential.

00:13:56.204 --> 00:13:59.037
We often use quick and easy labels
to describe our feelings.

00:13:59.204 --> 00:14:01.162
I'm stressed as the most
common one, I hear.